# Example configuration for installing from GitHub Packages
#
# To use this package from GitHub Packages:
# 1. Copy this file to your project root as .npmrc
# 2. Replace TOKEN with your GitHub Personal Access Token (with read:packages scope)
#
# To create a token:
# 1. Go to GitHub Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Tokens (classic)
# 2. Generate new token with 'read:packages' scope
# 3. Copy the token and add it below
#
# Then install with:
#   pnpm add @soundtrackyourbrand/graphox-cli

@soundtrackyourbrand:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=TOKEN
